### Vehicle Recovery App - API Demo
### Open in VS Code with "REST Client" extension
### Click "Send Request" above each request

@base = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Health check
GET {{base}}/health HTTP/1.1

### 2. Public countries list
GET {{base}}/api/countries HTTP/1.1

### 3. Login as super admin (save cookie)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "superadmin@vra.local",
  "password": "ChangeMe-Admin-2026!"
}

### 4. Get current user
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me HTTP/1.1

### 5. List all countries (super admin)
GET {{base}}/api/super/countries HTTP/1.1

### 6. QA country detail (settings + services)
GET {{base}}/api/super/countries/QA HTTP/1.1

### 7. Super analytics (all countries)
GET {{base}}/api/super/analytics HTTP/1.1

### 8. Create a QA country admin
POST {{base}}/api/super/country-admins HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "qa.admin.demo@example.com",
  "password": "QaAdminPass123!",
  "full_name": "QA Admin Demo",
  "country_code": "QA"
}

### 9. Register a customer
# @name regCustomer
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "role": "customer",
  "full_name": "Demo Customer",
  "email": "demo.customer@example.com",
  "password": "DemoPass1234",
  "country_code": "QA"
}

### 10. Verify email (copy dev_verify_token from #9)
# @name verify
GET {{base}}/api/auth/verify-email?token=PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_REGISTER HTTP/1.1

### 11. Login as new customer
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "demo.customer@example.com",
  "password": "DemoPass1234"
}

### 12. Customer profile
GET {{base}}/api/customer/profile HTTP/1.1

### 13. Add a vehicle
POST {{base}}/api/customer/vehicles HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "category": "suv",
  "registration_number": "QA-DEMO1",
  "make": "Toyota",
  "model": "Land Cruiser",
  "colour": "White"
}

### 14. Add a destination
POST {{base}}/api/customer/destinations HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "label": "Home workshop",
  "address": "Doha Industrial Area",
  "lat": 25.2,
  "lng": 51.5
}

### 15. Fare estimate (towing)
POST {{base}}/api/customer/bookings/estimate HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "service_type": "towing",
  "service_level": "normal",
  "pickup": { "lat": 25.3, "lng": 51.5, "address": "Doha" },
  "destination": { "lat": 25.3, "lng": 51.55, "address": "Workshop" },
  "vehicle": { "category": "suv", "registration_number": "QA-DEMO1" }
}

### 16. Create booking (copy total_minor from #15 as agreed_fare_minor)
POST {{base}}/api/customer/bookings HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "service_type": "towing",
  "service_level": "normal",
  "pickup": { "lat": 25.3, "lng": 51.5, "address": "Doha" },
  "destination": { "lat": 25.3, "lng": 51.55, "address": "Workshop" },
  "vehicle": { "category": "suv", "registration_number": "QA-DEMO1" },
  "agreed_fare_minor": 0
}

### 17. Start dispatch (copy booking id from #16)
POST {{base}}/api/customer/bookings/1/dispatch HTTP/1.1

### 18. My bookings
GET {{base}}/api/customer/bookings HTTP/1.1

### 19. Track booking (copy booking id)
GET {{base}}/api/customer/bookings/1/tracking HTTP/1.1

### 20. Admin reports - bookings
GET {{base}}/api/admin/reports/bookings HTTP/1.1

### 21. Admin reports - financials
GET {{base}}/api/admin/reports/financials HTTP/1.1

### 22. Admin reports - drivers
GET {{base}}/api/admin/reports/drivers HTTP/1.1

### 23. CSV export
GET {{base}}/api/admin/reports/bookings.csv HTTP/1.1